# Platinum Angel and drawing from an empty library (CR 704.5b, 104.3c). Bot1's library holds one card after the opening
# hand, drawn on turn 3, so turn 5's draw is attempted from an empty library: with the Angel out Bot1 doesn't lose, and the
# state-based action looks only at a draw attempted since the last check (CR 704.5b), so once that check has passed the
# attempt is gone. On turn 6 Bot2 Disenchants the Angel and Bot1 does not lose: nothing has been drawn from the empty
# library since. Then Bot2's Ancestral Recall makes Bot1 draw three cards from the empty library, with no Angel, and Bot1
# loses (CR 704.5b, 121.4).

